# - compile is load-bearing: 2.04x throughput AND memory 22.7G->13.5G (fuses
#   the parallel-scan intermediates). Eager numbers reproduce the panel's
#   feared band (13-23%); the penalty is an eager artifact, not architectural.
# - budget: measured-MFU projection ~3.7x cheaper than the panel's estimate
